<title>POLAND: Optimus gets PLN 7.6 mln payout from unit.</title>
<headline>Optimus gets PLN 7.6 mln payout from unit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish computer firm Optimus SA will receive 7.6 million zlotys in dividend payouts from its 88.3-percent-owned cash register producer  Optimus Inter Commerce SA (Optimus IC), Optimus said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
